.TH BYTEKEYS-GUI 1 "October 2026" "ByteKeys 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
bytekeys-gui \- ByteKeys keyboard lighting control panel
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bytekeys-gui
[\fB\-\-minimized\fR] [\fB\-\-demo\fR] [\fB\-\-local\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens the ByteKeys control panel: brightness, colors, effects, automation
rules and profiles for the keyboard lighting of this laptop. It also adds a
tray icon with quick controls.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-minimized
Start hidden in the tray (used when started at login).
.TP
.B \-\-demo
Add simulated keyboards.
.TP
.B \-\-local
Do not use the bytekeysd service (portable mode).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR bytekeys (1),
.BR bytekeysd (8)
